The first implementation now passes all local gates at the current hard preset. Its instances are native regular graphs \(K_N\) minus a cycle 2-factor; the witness is a maximum bisection, and verification is just an exact half-sum plus crossing-count check. The structure-aware guess test found 0 valid answers in 200,000 trials, all six non-reference attacks failed on 8/8 seeds, and the successful Track B reference method costs about 296,000 operations per instance versus 288 after the residue decomposition is recognized. I’m moving to the script-owned oracle ladder now.
